==English==
[[File:(MHNT) Enoplognatha ovata on Daucus carota.jpg|thumb|A '''cobweb spider''' ({{taxlink|Enoplognatha ovata|species}})]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any spider of the world-spanning family {{taxfmt|Theridiidae|family}}, that build tangle space webs and have a comb of serrated bristles (setae) on the tarsus of the fourth leg.

====Synonyms====
* {{vern|tangle web spider}}, {{vern|tangle-web spider}}; {{l|en|comb-footed spider}}

====Coordinate terms====
* [[funnel-web spider]] ({{taxlink|Atracidae|family}}, {{taxlink|Macrothelidae|family}}), [[purseweb spider]] ({{taxlink|Atypidae|family}}), {{vern|scaffold web spider}} ({{taxlink|Nesticidae|family}}), {{vern|pan-web spider}} ({{taxlink|Cyrtophora exanthematica|species}}, in {{taxfmt|Araneidae|family}}), {{vern|tube-web spider}} ({{taxlink|Segestriidae|family}}), [[orb-web spider]] ({{taxfmt|Araneidae|family}})

